#!/bin/bash
# One-time wrap-up after the first install.
set -euo pipefail

mkdir -p {{ joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir .projectsDir | quote }} # zellij's file picker opens here

cat <<'EOF'

==> Done. A few things to finish by hand:

  1. GitHub SSH key. gitconfig sends all github.com traffic over SSH, so
     pushes (and `chezmoi update`) need a key:
       ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C "<your email>"
       gh auth login        # pick SSH and let it upload the key

  2. Start the Docker VM before using docker:
       colima start

  3. Open Ghostty. Your shell, prompt and zellij take it from there.

EOF
